🧩 3. Chroma

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

ChromaDB is simple and developer-friendly.

---

🔹 Features

✔ Easy setup
✔ Great for prototyping
✔ Popular in RAG tutorials

---

💻 Example

```python id="chroma_example"
import chromadb

client = chromadb.Client()
collection = client.create_collection("docs")

collection.add(
    documents=["AI is transforming industries."],
    ids=["doc1"]
)

results = collection.query(
    query_texts=["What is AI?"],
    n_results=1
)
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🐘 4. pgvector

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

pgvector adds vector search capabilities to PostgreSQL.

---

🔹 Features

✔ Use existing PostgreSQL infrastructure
✔ Combine SQL + vector search
✔ Ideal for applications already using PostgreSQL

---

⚔️ Comparison Table

| Feature     | FAISS        | Milvus                 | ChromaDB    | pgvector                   |
| ----------- | ------------ | ---------------------- | ----------- | -------------------------- |
| Type        | Library      | Vector DB              | Vector DB   | PostgreSQL Extension       |
| Best For    | Local search | Large-scale production | Prototyping | SQL-based apps             |
| Scalability | High         | Very High              | Medium      | High                       |
| Ease of Use | Medium       | Medium                 | Easy        | Easy (if using PostgreSQL) |

---

🧠 Which One Should You Choose?

FAISS

* Fast local similarity search
* Research and experimentation

Milvus

* Enterprise-scale deployment

ChromaDB

* Beginners and prototypes

pgvector

* Existing PostgreSQL applications

